Sita demands proof of Rama contact and bodily marks --- Hanuman describes Rama virtues and auspicious marks --- Hanuman tells carrying princes to Sugriva and forging alliance --- Rama vows to restore Sugriva and Sugriva shows dropped jewels --- Rama laments over jewels and burns without Sita --- Rama kills Valin and sends searchers in ten directions --- Despairing searchers learn from Sampati that Sita lives in Ravana house --- Hanuman leaps ocean finds Sita and wins her trust
